287 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (We used propositional logic and model checking. Each person is a knight \(always truthful\) or a knave \(always lies\). We encoded what each person says with Implication\(AKnight, statement\) and Implication\(AKnave, Not\(statement\)\). Then model_check\(\) found who must be a knight or a knave.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
